---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Chen LM · 个人主页" description="你好，我是 Chen LM。控制科学与工程硕士在读，记录正在学习的东西、做过的尝试，以及一点关于我。">
  <div class="personal-page wrap">
    <section class="intro" id="about" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
      <p class="intro-label">一点关于我</p>
      <h1 id="intro-title">你好，我是 <span>Chen LM.</span></h1>
      <p class="intro-lead">在学习，也在慢慢找到自己的方向。</p>
      <div class="intro-copy">
        <p>控制科学与工程硕士在读。目前把时间放在学习、项目和实习准备上，对数据如何帮助我们做决策很感兴趣。</p>
        <p>遇到一个问题，我通常想先弄明白它为什么成立，再试着把它做出来。我喜欢清楚的解释、简洁的实现，也愿意在发现问题时调整方向。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="intro-links"><a href="/resume/">我的简历 ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/Brolem" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><a href="#work">最近在做什么 ↓</a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="personal-section" aria-labelledby="now-title">
      <div class="personal-heading"><h2 id="now-title">最近在学什么</h2><span>持续积累中</span></div>
      <dl class="now-list">
        <div><dt>数据与预测</dt><dd>练习用 Python 整理数据，理解预测结果怎样服务于实际决策。</dd></div>
        <div><dt>建模与优化</dt><dd>结合项目学习数学建模和随机规划，试着解释清楚每一个假设。</dd></div>
        <div><dt>把想法做出来</dt><dd>使用 AI 辅助编码与学习，通过小实验检验想法，也补齐自己的基础。</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="personal-section" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
      <div class="personal-heading"><h2 id="work-title">最近在做的事</h2><span>进行中</span></div>
      <article class="project-note">
        <h3>算电协同：让计算任务与能源更好地配合</h3>
        <p>电力供应和计算需求都不完全确定，如何安排任务、储能和购电？这是我目前在研究的问题，也是学习数据分析和优化方法的实践场。</p>
        <p class="project-progress">已完成一轮四组对照验证，仍在分析结果与改进方法。</p>
        <a class="note-link" href="/projects/bilateral-uncertainty/">看看项目进展 ↗</a>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="personal-section" aria-labelledby="personality-title">
      <div class="personal-heading"><h2 id="personality-title">和我一起做事</h2></div>
      <div class="working-copy">
        <p><strong>我会多问一句“为什么”。</strong>比起只得到答案，我更希望理解过程，知道哪些地方还不确定。</p>
        <p><strong>我偏好简单、清楚。</strong>把问题说清楚，先验证一个小想法，再决定要不要做得更复杂。</p>
        <p><strong>我也在学习把节奏放稳。</strong>用 AI 加快尝试，同时给理解细节和复核结果留出时间。</p>
      </div>
      <details class="personality-details">
        <summary>更多了解：Big Five 性格测评</summary>
        <p>一份性格倾向的参考，也欢迎从实际交流中了解我。</p>
        <iframe title="Chen LM 的 Big Five 性格测评结果" src="https://bigfivepersonality.me/zh/embed/Ve876xSS" width="440" height="500" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe>
        <a class="note-link" href="https://bigfivepersonality.me/zh/embed/Ve876xSS" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">在原网站打开 ↗</a>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section class="personal-section next-note" aria-labelledby="next-title">
      <h2 id="next-title">接下来</h2>
      <p>继续积累项目经验，也在关注上海的实习机会：能源数字化、算力资源与成本分析，以及优化决策相关方向。</p>
      <a class="note-link" href="/resume/">查看公开版简历 ↗</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
<style>
  .personal-page { max-width: 860px; }
  .intro { padding: 90px 0 66px; scroll-margin-top: 30px; }
  .intro-label { color: #57606a; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 24px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 60px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 22px; }
  h1 span { color: #16758a; }
  .intro-lead { font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.6; color: #344654; margin: 0 0 25px; }
  .intro-copy { max-width: 720px; }
  .intro-copy p, .working-copy p, .next-note p { color: #344654; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .intro-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px 28px; margin-top: 28px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #226879; }
  .intro-links a:hover, .note-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 5px; }
  .personal-section { border-top: 1px solid #cddce2; padding: 30px 0 44px; scroll-margin-top: 30px; }
  .personal-heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 23px; }
  h2 { font-size: 25px; letter-spacing: 0; font-weight: 600; margin: 0; }
  .personal-heading > span { color: #57606a; font-size: 14px; }
  .now-list { margin: 0; }
  .now-list > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 125px 1fr; gap: 24px; padding: 13px 0; }
  dt { font-size: 17px; color: #263b4a; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.8; }
  dd { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: #344654; margin: 0; }
  .project-note { padding: 25px 28px; border: 1px solid #d4e2e8; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(237,244,247,.88); }
  h3 { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .project-note p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: #344654; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .project-note .project-progress { font-size: 15px; color: #57606a; }
  .note-link { display: inline-block; color: #226879; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 8px; }
  .working-copy strong { color: #263b4a; font-weight: 600; }
  .personality-details { margin-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #dbe5e9; padding-top: 19px; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; color: #424a53; font-size: 16px; width: fit-content; }
  summary:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #126577; outline-offset: 5px; }
  .personality-details p { font-size: 16px; color: #57606a; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 20px; }
  iframe { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 440px; height: 500px; border: 1px solid #d7e1e7; border-radius: 7px; background: #fff; }
  .next-note { margin-bottom: 35px; }
  .next-note h2 { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  @media (max-width: 670px) {
    .intro { padding: 55px 0 43px; }
    .intro-lead { font-size: 19px; }
    .intro-copy p, .working-copy p, .next-note p { font-size: 17px; }
    .personal-section { padding: 25px 0 32px; }
    .now-list > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 5px; padding: 11px 0; }
    .project-note { padding: 20px; }
    h3 { font-size: 20px; }
  }
</style>
